     3,
     "<br><br><br>On Friday, November 30, 2012 11:55:22 AM UTC-8, Ben Goodrich wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">I said this part wrong:<br><br>On Friday, November 30, 2012 2:42:47 PM UTC-5, Ben Goodrich wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><br><div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  real eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">  ranef_group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ranef_prog</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">program</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>               b_var_1 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> var_1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> b_var_2 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> var_2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> b_var_3 </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> var_3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">];</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div></div></blockquote><div> <br>The way I set it up, there is no b_var_k but a vector b of length K because doing matrix algebra is faster. So, I should have said<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">model </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  eta </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">var</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> b</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">N</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> eta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><code><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">ranef_group</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span></span><span style=\"color:#008\"><span style=\"color:#008\">group</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\"> ranef_prog</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">program</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span></span><span style=\"color:#660\"><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"></span></code><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>and so on.<br><br>Ben<br><br></div></blockquote>"
